"P4206633977" "There have been a number of disappearances reported lately, and I think we both know who's behind them: the Circle of Thorns. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>I want you to defeat as many mystics as you can find.</A> Maybe we can stop any more people from falling into the Circle's clutches."
