"P2647276060" "I just got an urgent message from MAGI. It seems that Steel Canyon has recently become supercharged with a very dark mystical energy. Azuria thinks the Circle of Thorns may be trying to summon a great demon there. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>I need you to stop the Circle from summoning a demon in Steel Canyon.</A> That zone has already seen enough trouble!"
// AcceptString :
"P3069208334" "Stop Circle from summoning a demon in Steel Canyon"
// SendOffString :
"P2832739577" "Azuria believes you should concentrate your efforts on Gimry Ridge and the Copper District."
