"P1703747064" "Combat Circle in Steel Canyon"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P1750768696" "Steel Canyon is still suffused with mystical energy. If MAGI is right, the Circle could summon that demon any minute."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P359286669" "You have prevented the Circle of Thorns from summoning a demon in Steel Canyon."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1795023765" "Thanks for dealing with those Circle mystics. I guess we'll never know whether they were really trying to summon a demon in Steel Canyon. Frankly, that's just fine by me."
